  "runtime_scope": "Test092 is loaded and its UUID matches the deployed build. A 300.085-second/60-sample passive Wi-Fi observation and en1-bound gateway HTTP plus two Apple HTTPS requests passed without counter growth; DNS and long-term stability were not tested. The user still reports delayed power-off UI, brief off/on appearance during enable and slow network-list scans. One off operation took 14.035 seconds before/including a 0.029895-second driver power call; its preceding disassociation wait remains unlocalized. Private-address restarts can emit power changes but exact UI causation is unproven. Current matrix: 4 passed, 2 partial, 34 uncovered, 0 regressed. RX149 input profile is enabled, but fault recovery, peer reception, native inbound delivery and AirDrop were not tested. No new candidate or EFI modification in this runtime investigation."
